`labelsC7_partsSeparated` (all base-independent). `flatC3`, `flatC2`, `flatC5`,
`canvasMargins`, `fitClosed`, `subInputB`, and `stepC2` are discharged by their
no-hypothesis theorems; `flatC6` by `flatC6B_layoutXW` with closed chain and
loop cases; `frameClear` by `frameClearanceSeam_holds` over the executed
bracket premises; `labelRuns` and `captions` replay the `baseSeams_of_layered`
